      "jp": "お、いいじゃんいいじゃん！^00じゃあさ、二人でちょっと考えてみよっか。^00そしたらいいアイデアも浮かぶっしょ！",
      "en_original": "Ooh, good idea! Then hey, wanna try brainstorming together? I'm sure we'll come up with a good idea that way!",
      "en_auxiliary": "Ooh, good idea! Then hey, wanna try brainstorming together? I'm sure we'll come up with a good idea that way!",
      "en": "Ooh, good idea! Then hey, wanna try brainstorming together? I'm sure we'll come up with a good idea that way!",
