      },
      "jp": "うん、そうそう。^00アイデア出し合うの楽しかったし、^00すごい学生っぽい気がするー！",
      "en_original": "Yeah, that's right! Our brainstorming lesson was fun, and it lead to important student memories! We did it!",
      "en_auxiliary": "Yeah, that's right! Our brainstorming session was fun, and it lead to important student memories! We did it!",
      "en": "Yeah, that's right! Our brainstorming lesson was fun, and it lead to important student memories! We did it!",
