      "attributes": {
        "String_No": "33357833"
      },
      "jp": "もーやだー！　居残りなんてやだー！^00宿題忘れたくらいで居残りなんて、^00絶対おかしいってばー！",
      "en_original": "This is the worst! I don't wanna stay for detention! It's not fair! All I did was forget my homework!",
      "en_auxiliary": "This is the worst! I don't wanna stay for detention! It's not fair! All I did was forget my homework!",
