      "jp": "ねぇ居残りホントにやなんだってばー！^00確かにテストの成績悪かったけど！^00特別課題なんてまっぴらごめんなのー！",
      "en_original": "I seriously don't wanna stay for detention! Yeah, I got a bad grade on my test, but extra lessons? Come on!",
      "en_auxiliary": "I seriously don't wanna stay for detention! Yeah, I got a bad grade on my test, but extra lessons? Come on!",
